NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY MODEL WEIGHTS

The `photo_restore` sub-project relies on pre-trained model weights distributed
by their original authors under their own licenses (GFPGAN, Real-ESRGAN,
BasicSR, facexlib). These weights are downloaded at runtime and are NOT
covered by this MIT license. Please consult the upstream repositories for
their respective terms of use, especially for commercial deployments.
